// src/std/collections/collections.zen
// the folder's public surface: starred re-exports only. Entry and
// Vec.grow are absent on purpose — `*` is the one gate, so Vec travels
// with add/get/set/take, never grow or Entry.
//
// each name is both the type and the ufcs constructor `alloc.Vec<T>()`
// calls — one name, travels together. str's Eq/Hash impls are on loan
// from std.text; an impl travels with its type, not through a re-export.

Vec* = std.collections.collections_vec
Map* = std.collections.collections_map
